# Bare-numeric-filename scratch state dropped directly in .claude/ (ad hoc
# continuation-prompt/session-handoff files, not the CONTINUATION.md
# convention) — ephemeral and can carry personal details, never committed.
.claude/[0-9]*
_screenshot.js
_run.sh
